1f:["$","article",null,{"className":"article-body article-body--guide","children":[null,null,["$","section","2-Documents: audit the file before paying",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-3","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Documents: audit the file before paying"}],[["$","p","Polimi's checklist requires qualification evidence, the bachelor's transcript, an official CGPA/grading-scale statement and CV; relevant design/architecture routes also require a portfolio. Its page warns that documents cannot be changed or added after application-fee payment.",{"children":"Polimi's checklist requires qualification evidence, the bachelor's transcript, an official CGPA/grading-scale statement and CV; relevant design/architecture routes also require a portfolio. Its page warns that documents cannot be changed or added after application-fee payment."}],["$","p","Run a pre-payment review: readable scans, complete sides, correct names, appropriate language and the correct programme selection. If your final qualification is not available, use the official checklist to confirm the permitted provisional or final-year evidence. Keep a question log rather than uploading an unexplained incomplete file.",{"children":"Run a pre-payment review: readable scans, complete sides, correct names, appropriate language and the correct programme selection. If your final qualification is not available, use the official checklist to confirm the permitted provisional or final-year evidence. Keep a question log rather than uploading an unexplained incomplete file."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined"]}],["$","section","3-English evidence and other language obligations",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-4","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"English evidence and other language obligations"}],[["$","p","Use the 2027–2028 document list for accepted certificates and MOI conditions. The Italy English comparison guide gives the test thresholds and TOEFL test-date distinction.",{"children":"Use the 2027–2028 document list for accepted certificates and MOI conditions. The Italy English comparison guide gives the test thresholds and TOEFL test-date distinction."}],["$","p","Language evidence may be provided after the initial academic application under the stated process, but that does not make it optional. Separately check any Italian requirement for your teaching language and any graduation obligation.",{"children":"Language evidence may be provided after the initial academic application under the stated process, but that does not make it optional. Separately check any Italian requirement for your teaching language and any graduation obligation."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined",["$","nav",null,{"className":"answer-links","aria-label":"Next steps for English evidence and other language obligations","children":[["$","$L5","/guides/study-in-italy-admission-english-requirements/",{"href":"/guides/study-in-italy-admission-english-requirements/","children":["Read the English-score comparison",["$","$L6",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$8:props:children:2:props:children:1:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"}]]}]]}]]}],["$","section","4-Merit funding: admission alone is not enough",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-5","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Merit funding: admission alone is not enough"}],[["$","p","The 2027–2028 call makes early-bird admission payment a condition and requires a separate Online Services scholarship form. The call gives an acceptance administrative charge of approximately €190; its PDF takes priority over the overview page's older approximate figure.",{"children":"The 2027–2028 call makes early-bird admission payment a condition and requires a separate Online Services scholarship form. The call gives an acceptance administrative charge of approximately €190; its PDF takes priority over the overview page's older approximate figure."}]],"$undefined","$L23","$undefined","$undefined","$L24","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined"]}],"$L25","$L26","$L27"]}]
